    {
      "id": "p0233-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In the original Japanese version of Gunstar Heroes, players can fight \"MELON PAN\", a bizarre enemy whose name comes from a popular Japanese snack of the same name. In the English-language release of Gunstar Heroes, \"MELON PAN\" was translated literally as \"MELON BREAD\".",
        "raw": "In the original Japanese version of Gunstar Heroes, players can fight \"MELON\nPAN\", a bizarre enemy whose name comes from a popular Japanese snack of\nthe same name. In the English-language release of Gunstar Heroes, \"MELON\nPAN\" was translated literally as \"MELON BREAD\".",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
