    {
      "id": "p0233-b009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "As a tribute to this localization choice in Gunstar Heroes, Toby requested that the \"Lemon Bread\" enemy in Undertale be renamed \"LEMON PAN\" in the Japanese script. This change ensures that Toby's Gunstar Heroes reference will remain intact and recognizable to Japanese players.",
        "raw": "As a tribute to this localization choice in Gunstar Heroes, Toby requested that\nthe \"Lemon Bread\" enemy in Undertale be renamed \"LEMON PAN\" in the\nJapanese script. This change ensures that Toby's Gunstar Heroes reference will\nremain intact and recognizable to Japanese players.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09388793,
          0.83014286,
          0.7025031,
          0.89855
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09170662,
          0.82942857,
          0.7045417,
          0.89962143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          89,
          90,
          91,
          92
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "为了致敬《Gunstar Heroes》当年的本地化处理，Toby 要求把《Undertale》日文剧本里的“Lemon Bread”改名为“LEMON PAN”（柠檬面包）。这样，日本玩家也能认出这个致敬。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
